{"3653480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Time Survivor", "steam_appid": 3653480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal: </strong>survive in the arena  fighting against <strong>Time</strong> and enemies. The longer you survive the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e32a87e68e8.poster.avif?t=1780939087\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e32a87e68e8.webm?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e32a87e68e8.mp4?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Survivor is an action arena incremental, where you have to survive while your life energy increasingly decays over time. If you die you can start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay alive you have to collect <strong>Energy Orbs</strong> that restore your energy while <strong>dodging</strong> and <strong>killing enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c5e671f4c005bc9e775d6be81dcbb0f5.poster.avif?t=1780939087\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c5e671f4c005bc9e775d6be81dcbb0f5.webm?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c5e671f4c005bc9e775d6be81dcbb0f5.mp4?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you die, you can use the collected resources to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>Skill Tree </strong>to increase your stats and unlock new skills, making you stronger for the next trial!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The upgrade tree has four main branches:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECONOMY</strong>: Upgrades that enhance the farming aspect of the game, such as increasing the value of resources you collect or the number of drops from enemies.  <br>But be careful—these upgrades also buff the enemies! Don't be too greedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVEMENT</strong>: Upgrades that increase your speed and improve your movement around the map, fundamental for dodging enemies and reaching resources faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENERGY</strong>: Upgrades that increase your life energy, give you armor, enhance the energy recovered from energy orbs, and so on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong>: Upgrades that expand your offensive arsenal, giving you the option to fight back and effectively become a predator instead of prey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c2a37af786b5eaf0bffef165772f9312.poster.avif?t=1780939087\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c2a37af786b5eaf0bffef165772f9312.webm?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c2a37af786b5eaf0bffef165772f9312.mp4?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong> prey</strong> to<strong> predator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the core mechanics of the game is the<strong> Dash</strong> that you can buy in the skill tree and that you can upgrade during a run. You can damage enemies to kill them and obtain new resources to power up even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/1a74107129fe511880922cae9343a761.poster.avif?t=1780939087\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/1a74107129fe511880922cae9343a761.webm?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/1a74107129fe511880922cae9343a761.mp4?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you reach a new minute mark, a new challenging<strong> boss</strong> appears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to kill them all?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal: </strong>survive in the arena  fighting against <strong>Time</strong> and enemies. The longer you survive the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e32a87e68e8.poster.avif?t=1780939087\" width=608 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e32a87e68e8.webm?t=1780939087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/c403cdc42fe256605a9e2e